Tool of the Day
NoteGPT

Chrome Extension

NoteGPT helps summarize YouTube videos, articles, PDFs, and web content using AI, making learning faster and more efficient.

How to set up NoteGPT
1
Open the Chrome Web Store link.
2
Click 'Add to Chrome'.
3
Pin the extension to your browser toolbar.
4
Open a YouTube video.
5
Use NoteGPT to generate summaries and notes.
6
Explore AI-powered learning features.
